# Audi A4 B7 four-door saloon, 2005-2008.
#
# The B7 facelift of the B6 shell: 4,586 mm long, 1,772 mm wide, 1,427 mm high,
# 2,648 mm wheelbase; the first A4 with the single-frame grille. 1.6-3.2 petrol
# and 2.0/3.0 TDI, front-wheel drive or quattro.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audi_A4
#
# Colours: Brilliant Black, Quartz Silver, Deep Sea Blue and Brilliant Red are
# period Audi finishes.
#
# Weight: 220 in total (black 65, silver 65, blue 50, red 40).
#
# Speed 220 km/h; comfort 125/518 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 2005-2008 with a road tail to about 2018.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/audi-a4-b7.blend. References:
# citycars/references/audi-a4-b7/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

